title: 'dispute-coordinator: enforce spam slots per validator in batched imports'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The spam-slot check in `handle_import_statements` was OR'd across all new invalid voters of an
    `ImportStatements` batch, so a single validator with a free slot let an already-capped
    validator's invalid vote be persisted and counted towards dispute thresholds. Spam slots are
    now enforced per validator: invalid votes from capped validators are dropped from the import
    and the dispute state is recomputed from the remaining votes. If every new invalid voter is
    capped, the import is still rejected.
crates:
- name: polkadot-node-core-dispute-coordinator
  bump: patch
